 one (973-655-3340).\nCost for Students $10\;  $20 Faculty/Staff\nRegistra
 tion Opens on Fusion on Tuesday\, May 26\, 2026\n\nWhere and when?\n\nJun
 e 2nd\, 2026\n9:00 am – 6:00 pm   \nBegins at Student Recreation Center\n
 \nWhat to bring: Water\, lunch\, bug spray\, sunscreen\, towel and bathin
 g suit \nPotential Hazards: Unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat 
 exhaustion\, dehydration\, allergic reactions/poisonous plants\, and inse
 ct bites.\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can b
 e found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12474105
