  majors. Sessions are held Wednesdays at 1:00 PM on Zoom. RSVP on Engage 
 to receive the Zoom link. A google calendar invite will be sent once RSVP
 . \n\nHosted by: Prestigious Scholarships \n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12469445
