BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a relaxing day paddling down the Delaware River and lear
 n some basic kayaking skills. Leaving from Montclair State University\, N
 J\, this full-day trip will provide you with a chance to enjoy the warm\,
  clear waters of the longest undammed river east of the Mississippi. We p
 rovide the boats\, life jackets and paddles\, but be prepared to get wet.
 \nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegister online through Fusion\, in the Student Re
 creation Center main office\, or over the phone (973-655-3340).\nCost for
  Students $10\;  $20 Faculty/Staff\nRegistration Opens on Fusion on Tuesd
 ay\, May 26\, 2026\n\n \nWhere and When?\n\nJune 10\, 2026\n9:00 am – 6:0
 0 pm   \nBegins at Student Recreation Center\n\nWhat to bring: Water\, lu
 nch\, bathing suit\, towel\, sunblock and a change of clothes.\nPotential
  Hazards: under/above water obstructions\, rapidly moving water\, poisono
 us plants/allergies\, insect bites\, unpredictable weather changes\, sunb
 urn/heat exhaustion\, dehydration\n\nHosted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAddi
 tional Information can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/enga
 ge/event/12474130
DTEND:20260610T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260531T042730Z
DTSTART:20260610T130000Z
LOCATION:Meet at the Student Recreation Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kayaking on the Delaware River
